  The \textsf{minted} [5] package for \LaTeX\ typesets code
  with syntax highlighting from the Pygments [1] library
  for Python.  With version 3, \textsf{minted} enhances security and
  usability while adding new features and simplifying future
  development.  The package includes a new Python executable called
  \texttt{latexminted} that is compatible with restricted shell
  escape.  Usability is improved by new debugging and error reporting
  capabilities.
  
  The redesign makes possible several additional
  features, including support for custom lexers and the ability to
  select snippets of code with regular expressions.  The new
  architecture also allows future features to be developed using Python.
